{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026UrmFssXdsG1793524259.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>澳門上月賭收按年跌一成，連跌五個月。</p><p></p><p>澳門博彩監察協調局公布，10月份博彩毛收入216.8億澳門元，按月回升約兩成，按年則跌一成。而今年首十個月計，澳門博彩毛收入累計2,087.9億澳門元，按年升百分之1.6。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:20.583884+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T09:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T01:38:11.163549+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T01:20:51.332490+00:00","content_hash":"22f033a755c3749be0fa9a90c648a9f6b363d5aa08b794aadc1436eafe141019","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:20.583884+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}